// From the law: the Schedule's blazon and picture show seven equal stripes, green, yellow,
// red, black, red, yellow, green, and a white pile from the hoist, edged black.
// From elsewhere: 1:2, the pile's length of 84 and its edge of 3 are FOTW's construction on
// 126 x 252. The picture measures about 86 and 3.
// Measured from the Schedule's picture on the same grid, with 650 x 335 pixels as 252 x 126:
//   star: five tips averaged give center (35.2, 62.7) and mean radius 27.1, so (35, 63), 27
//     a regular star of that size lands within about 2 units of each tip
//   bird: bounding box 17.4 to 52.7 by 38.5 to 81.8, so center (35, 60.2), height 43.3
// The bird's frame is a little larger than 43.3, to hold the outline's stroke.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Zimbabwe"
  date "1980-04-18"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "LicenseRef-Public-Domain"
  adapted-from "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Zimbabwe.svg" {
    author "Fry1989"
    author "Great Brightstar"
    author "Smasongarrison"
    author "VexilAlpaca"
    author "LiamHollingsworth20"
    author "Jeff G."
    author "MapGrid"
    author "Djali08"
    author "Odder"
    license "LicenseRef-Public-Domain"
    part "the Great Zimbabwe Bird"
  }
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20250618084136/https://www.jsc.org.zw/upload/Acts/2001/1010updated.pdf"
  source "https://law.co.zw/?p=1734"
  source "https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/zw.html"
  source "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Zimbabwe.svg"
  note "The law has a blazon and a picture and no figures. Its picture is a small print with a slightly distorted scan, so the star and bird sizes measured from it are good to about 2 units."
  note "The blazon says a molet of five points, and this draws it regular. FOTW's Heimer, working from a colored copy with construction lines, reports an irregular star with radii of 32 and 27.5 centered 34 from the hoist. Those radii don't fit the Act's printed picture, where the tips are about 26 to 29 from the center. FOTW also reports a 1983 Ministry of Information leaflet with an irregular star, and flags of both kinds."
  note "The bird's drawing comes from the Commons file and isn't from the law. It's more slender than the Schedule's bird, scaled here to its height: about 31 wide against the Schedule's 35. Its yellow is set to this palette's."
  note "The law gives no shades. The hex, Pantone and CMYK values are the Album des Pavillons 2023's, as reported by FOTW. Black and white are plain."
  law "Flag of Zimbabwe Act, Chapter 10:10" {
    source "https://web.archive.org/web/20250618084136/https://www.jsc.org.zw/upload/Acts/2001/1010updated.pdf"
    source "https://law.co.zw/?p=1734"
  }
  restriction "Section 6: burning, mutilating or otherwise insulting the Flag, a resembling flag or a reproduction, in circumstances likely to show disrespect, is an offence." {
    source "https://web.archive.org/web/20250618084136/https://www.jsc.org.zw/upload/Acts/2001/1010updated.pdf"
  }
}
palette {
  green "#007d4e" {
    pantone "348 C"
    cmyk 100 0 80 25
  }
  yellow "#ffc726" {
    pantone "123 C"
    cmyk 0 24 88 0
  }
  red "#ea0437" {
    pantone "185 C"
    cmyk 0 98 72 0
  }
  black "#000000"
  white "#ffffff"
}
proportion hoist=126 fly=252

bars green yellow red black red yellow green
pile white {
  from hoist
  depth 84
  fimbriate black 3
}
charge star red {
  radius 27
  at fly=35 hoist=63
}
charge svg yellow {
  at fly=35 hoist=60.2
  fly 31.2560
  hoist 43.7813
  markup #"""
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="2156 4194 2468 3457"><g fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="38">
		<path fill="currentColor" d="m2290 4580c-18-45-15-95 8-138 23-42 65-72 113-80 51-9 102-12 154-11 49-76 131-125 221-132 90-6 178 30 238 98 71 81 113 183 122 290l37 464 1412 1105a86 86 0 0 1-76 150l-59-17c-227 141-395 387-428 651l-85 672H2454l-198-769c-71-86-81-207-25-303 73-125 161-241 262-345 66-66 96-160 83-253-14-92-21-185-22-278-1-77 16-154 49-223l-19-694c-3-82-48-157-119-197z"/>
		<path d="m2465 4570 167-10m-29 901 580-390m232 1167c229 64 372 45 439-101m-852-566c-62 179 50 338 200 381l1258 357m-2040 631c-47-184 21-513 312-650 135-63 179-201 180-318 0-44 1-95 64-120m-720 1011 44-107c21 79 64 137 120 184 31-65 58-131 81-198 26 52 47 123 65 194-4-161 81-279 193-329l434-193c141-63 276-188 307-378m742 460H3008m-727 464h1751m-1346 381h1297m-1428-381 131 381v291m-63-509 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 124-124m-1366 269 90-90 128 128 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 128-128 128 128 97-97"/>
		<circle r="76" cx="2799" cy="4459"/>
		<circle r="145" cx="3139" cy="6730"/>
		<circle r="145" cx="3714" cy="6730"/>
	</g></svg>
"""#
}
